WEBVTT

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:00.990
Oh, meu deus.

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:02.410
Consegues?

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:04.550
Bebé: Sim.

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:07.020
- Uau!
- Uau!

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:09.000
DR: Mãe, ele está a andar

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:11.200
(Risos)

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.760
(Aplausos)

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.040
DR: Obrigado.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:19.480
(Aplausos)